20w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/08\/1-2-150x84.jpg 150w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/08\/1-2-500x281.jpg 500w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/08\/1-2-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/08\/1-2-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/08\/1-2-640x360.jpg 640w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/08\/1-2-960x540.jpg 960w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/08\/1-2-160x90.jpg 160w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/08\/1-2.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" \/><\/p>\n<p class=\"image-wrapper\"><img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-41401\" src=\"https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/08\/1-4-1920x1080.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" srcset=\"https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/08\/1-4-1920x1080.jpg 1920w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/08\/1-4-150x84.jpg 150w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/08\/1-4-500x281.jpg 500w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/08\/1-4-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/08\/1-4-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/08\/1-4-640x360.jpg 640w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/08\/1-4-960x540.jpg 960w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/08\/1-4-160x90.jpg 160w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/08\/1-4.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" \/><\/p>\n<p>Call of Duty Warzone b\u00e9n\u00e9ficiera des int\u00e9grations de Vanguard avec \u00e0 la cl\u00e9 une nouvelle carte, un nouveau gameplay et promet ainsi de nouvelles exp\u00e9riences.<\/p>\n<p class=\"image-wrapper\"><img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-41402\" src=\"https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/08\/1-5-1920x1080.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" srcset=\"https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/08\/1-5-1920x1080.jpg 1920w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/08\/1-5-150x84.jpg 150w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/08\/1-5-500x281.jpg 500w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/08\/1-5-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/08\/1-5-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/08\/1-5-640x360.jpg 640w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/08\/1-5-960x540.jpg 960w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/08\/1-5-160x90.jpg 160w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/08\/1-5.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" \/><\/p>\n<p>L\u2019espace disque occup\u00e9 risque de faire fr\u00e9mir plusieurs d\u2019entre vous. Il serait de 220 GO. Alors oui, plusieurs fuites parlent de 270GO, mais la version b\u00eata de 50 GO serait incluse dans ce calcul. Une fois le jeu sorti, son espace r\u00e9el diminuerait. En tout cas, compte tenu du prix d\u2019un SSD \u00e7a reste \u00e9norme pour un jeu.<\/p>\n<p>Call of Duty Vanguard est d\u2019ores et d\u00e9j\u00e0 disponible en pr\u00e9vente. Le solo et le multi sont d\u00e9velopp\u00e9 par Sledgehammer Games avec l\u2019aide de Treyarch pour le mode zombies. Warzone est \u00e9galement d\u00e9velopp\u00e9 en collaboration avec Raven Software, tandis que Beenox, High Moon Studio, Demonware et Activison Shanghai ont \u00e9galement mis la main \u00e0 la patte sur Vanguard et Warzone.<\/p>\n<p class=\"image-wrapper\"><img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-41398\" src=\"https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/08\/1-1-1920x1080.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" srcset=\"https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/08\/1-1-1920x1080.jpg 1920w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/08\/1-1-150x84.jpg 150w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/08\/1-1-500x281.jpg 500w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/08\/1-1-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/08\/1-1-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/08\/1-1-640x360.jpg 640w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/08\/1-1-960x540.jpg 960w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/08\/1-1-160x90.jpg 160w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/08\/1-1.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" \/><\/p>\n<p class=\"image-wrapper\"><img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-41403\" src=\"https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/08\/1-6-1920x1080.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" srcset=\"https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/08\/1-6-1920x1080.jpg 1920w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/08\/1-6-150x84.jpg 150w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/08\/1-6-500x281.jpg 500w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/08\/1-6-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/08\/1-6-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/08\/1-6-640x360.jpg 640w, https:\/\/jeuxvideo.rds.ca\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/2\/2021\/08\/1-6-960x540.jpg 960w, https